SENTINEL Dino Chase README
--------------------------

Welcome to the game Dino Chase!
Dino Chase is a further development of the game Obstacle Runner.
To start the game enter "DC" at the prompt and press ENTER.
The display reads "DINO CHASE". Press any key to begin.

65 million years ago.
Asteroids are falling to Earth, chaos breaks out.
Dinosaur baby has lost its mother and is rushing around looking for her.
As dino baby you start at the leftmost display position.
Press the BACK key to jump over the boulders.
Asteroid fragments are coming towards you from the right.
Press the ENTER key to duck and dodge the asteroids.

If you hit a boulder or an asteroid hits you, "OUCH!" is displayed and
the game ends.
Press ESC to quit the game or any other key to restart.

